      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْجَلَانِيَّةٌ</span></b>  A woman <i>who is,</i> or <i>affects to be,</i> or
<i>makes herself, like a man in guise</i> or <i>in speech.</i>
(TA. [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلَةٌ</span>, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ</span>.])

